xref:name[$name(name)]

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... If let ``t`` be ``name``:
   .... Return ``t``.
  ... Else if let ``t`` be ``name``:
   .... Return ``t``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``nonTypeName`` be ``name``.

  ... If ``nonTypeName`` matches pattern ``+APPLY+``:
   .... Return ``"apply"``.
  ... Else if ``nonTypeName`` matches pattern ``+KEY+``:
   .... Return ``"key"``.
  ... Else if ``nonTypeName`` matches pattern ``+ACTIONS+``:
   .... Return ``"actions"``.
  ... Else if ``nonTypeName`` matches pattern ``+STATE+``:
   .... Return ``"state"``.
  ... Else if ``nonTypeName`` matches pattern ``+ENTRIES+``:
   .... Return ``"entries"``.
  ... Else if ``nonTypeName`` matches pattern ``+TYPE+``:
   .... Return ``"type"``.
  ... Else if ``nonTypeName`` matches pattern ``+PRIORITY+``:
   .... Return ``"priority"``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Check that ``name`` matches pattern ``+LIST+``.

  ... Return ``"list"``.

xref:tableCustomName[$tableCustomName(tableCustomName)]

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... If let ``t`` be ``tableCustomName``:
   .... Return ``t``.
  ... Else if let ``t`` be ``tableCustomName``:
   .... Return ``t``.
 .. {empty}
  ... If ``tableCustomName`` matches pattern ``+APPLY+``:
   .... Return ``"apply"``.
  ... Else if ``tableCustomName`` matches pattern ``+STATE+``:
   .... Return ``"state"``.
  ... Else if ``tableCustomName`` matches pattern ``+TYPE+``:
   .... Return ``"type"``.
  ... Else if ``tableCustomName`` matches pattern ``+PRIORITY+``:
   .... Return ``"priority"``.

