xref:to_number[$to_number(value)]

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``number`` be ``value``.

  ... If let ``+D+ i`` be ``number``:
   .... Return ``i``.
  ... Else if let ``w +S+ i`` be ``number``:
   .... Return ``xref:to_int[$to_int(w, i)]``.
  ... Else:
   .... Return ``i``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``numberValue`` be ``value``.

  ... Let!~type~ ``w +V+ i +#+ ++_++`` be ``numberValue``.

  ... Return ``i``.

