    ..... Check that ``tid`` is equal to ``tid'``.

    ..... The relation holds.
   .... Else:
    ..... Let!~type~ ``namedTypeIR'`` be ``typeIR'''''``.

    ..... Let!~type~ ``polyTypeDefIR~b~ +<+typeIR~b~^{asterisk}^+>+`` be ``namedTypeIR'``.

    ..... Let ``typeIR~a_spec~`` be ``xref:specialize_typeDef[$specialize_typeDef(polyTypeDefIR~a~, typeIR~a~^{asterisk}^)]``.
    ..... Let ``typeIR~b_spec~`` be ``xref:specialize_typeDef[$specialize_typeDef(polyTypeDefIR~b~, typeIR~b~^{asterisk}^)]``.
    ..... If xref:Type_alpha[``typeIR~a_spec~ +~~+ typeIR~b_spec~``] holds:
