 .. Else if let ``+BIT+ +<+w~to~+>+`` be ``numberTypeIR``:
  ... Let ``i'`` be ``xref:to_bitstr[$to_bitstr(w~to~, i)]``.
  ... Return ``w~to~ +W+ i'``.
 .. Else if let ``+INT+ +<+w~to~+>+`` be ``numberTypeIR``:
  ... Let ``i'`` be ``xref:to_bitstr[$to_bitstr(w~to~, i)]``.
  ... Return ``w~to~ +S+ i'``.
. Else if let ``aliasTypeIR`` be ``typeIR'''``:
 .. Let!~type~ ``+TYPE+ ++_++ typeIR`` be ``aliasTypeIR``.

 .. Return ``xref:cast_fixbit[$cast_fixbit(typeIR, w', i)]``.
. Else if let ``+SET+ +<+typeIR'^{asterisk}^+>+`` be ``typeIR'''``:
 .. Let!~type~ ``typeIR`` be ``typeIR'^{asterisk}^``.

 .. Return ``+SET+ +{+xref:cast_fixbit[$cast_fixbit(typeIR, w', i)]+}+``.

