xref:cast_fixint'[$cast_fixint'(typeIR''', w', i)]

. If let ``numberTypeIR`` be ``typeIR'''``:
 .. If ``numberTypeIR`` matches pattern ``+INT+``:
  ... Return ``+D+ xref:to_int[$to_int(w', i)]``.
