. Else if let ``+HEADER+ tid +{+( typeIR~f~ id~f~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Let ``value~cast~`` be ``xref:cast_op[$cast_op(typeIR~f~, value)]``, for all ``typeIR~f~`` in ``typeIR~f~^{asterisk}^``, ``value`` in ``value^{asterisk}^``, and ``value~cast~`` in ``value~cast~^{asterisk}^``.
