. Else if let ``+HEADER+ tid +{+( typeIR~t_f~ id~t_f~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR``:
 .. Let ``value^?^`` be ``xref:find_map[$find_map<id, value>(+{+( id~f~ +:+ value~f~ )^{asterisk}^+}+, id~t_f~)]``, for all ``id~t_f~`` in ``id~t_f~^{asterisk}^`` and ``value^?^`` in ``value^?^^{asterisk}^``.
 .. Check that ``value^?^`` is defined, for all ``value^?^`` in ``value^?^^{asterisk}^``.

 .. Let ``value~f'~`` be ``value^?^``, for all ``value^?^`` in ``value^?^^{asterisk}^`` and ``value~f'~`` in ``value~f'~^{asterisk}^``.
 .. Let ``value~f_cast~`` be ``xref:cast_op[$cast_op(typeIR~t_f~, value~f'~)]``, for all ``typeIR~t_f~`` in ``typeIR~t_f~^{asterisk}^``, ``value~f'~`` in ``value~f'~^{asterisk}^``, and ``value~f_cast~`` in ``value~f_cast~^{asterisk}^``.
 .. Return ``+HEADER+ tid +{+( value~f_cast~ id~f~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+``.

