xref:bitacc_op[$bitacc_op(value~b~, value~h~, value~l~)]

. Let ``i~b~`` be ``xref:to_number[$to_number(value~b~)]``.
. Let ``i~h~`` be ``xref:to_number[$to_number(value~h~)]``.
. Let ``i~l~`` be ``xref:to_number[$to_number(value~l~)]``.
