. Return ``w +W+ i``.

xref:sizeof[$sizeof(typeIR, text)]

. If ``text`` is equal to ``"minSizeInBits"``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits[$sizeof_minSizeInBits(typeIR)]``.
. Else if ``text`` is equal to ``"minSizeInBytes"``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBytes[$sizeof_minSizeInBytes(typeIR)]``.
. Else if ``text`` is equal to ``"maxSizeInBits"``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBits[$sizeof_maxSizeInBits(typeIR)]``.
. Else if ``text`` is equal to ``"maxSizeInBytes"``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBytes[$sizeof_maxSizeInBytes(typeIR)]``.

