xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits''[$sizeof_minSizeInBits''(typeIR'')]

. If let ``primitiveTypeIR`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Check that ``primitiveTypeIR`` matches pattern ``+BOOL+``.

 .. Return ``1``.
. Else if let ``numberTypeIR`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. If let ``+INT+ +<+w+>+`` be ``numberTypeIR``:
  ... Return ``w``.
 .. Else if let ``+BIT+ +<+w+>+`` be ``numberTypeIR``:
  ... Return ``w``.
 .. Else if let ``+VARBIT+ +<+++_+++>+`` be ``numberTypeIR``:
  ... Return ``0``.
. Else if let ``aliasTypeIR`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Let!~type~ ``+TYPE+ ++_++ typeIR`` be ``aliasTypeIR``.

 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits'[$sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``.
. Else if let ``enumTypeIR`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Let!~type~ ``+ENUM+ ++_++ +#+ typeIR +{+++_++^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``enumTypeIR``.

 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits'[$sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``.
. Else if let ``+TUPLE+ +<+typeIR^{asterisk}^+>+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:sum[$sum($sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)^{asterisk}^)]``.
. Else if let ``typeIR +[+n~size~+]+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits'[$sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)]`` * ``n~size~``.
. Else if let ``+STRUCT+ ++_++ +{+( typeIR ++_++ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:sum[$sum($sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)^{asterisk}^)]``.
. Else if let ``+HEADER+ ++_++ +{+( typeIR ++_++ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:sum[$sum($sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)^{asterisk}^)]``.
. Else if let ``+HEADER_UNION+ ++_++ +{+( typeIR ++_++ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:min[$min($sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)^{asterisk}^)]``.

xref:sizeof_minSizeInBytes[$sizeof_minSizeInBytes(typeIR)]

. Let ``n~size~`` be ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits'[$sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``.
. Return ``+D+ n~size~ / 8``.

xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBits[$sizeof_maxSizeInBits(typeIR)]

. Return ``+D+ xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBits'[$sizeof_maxSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``.

xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBits'[$sizeof_maxSizeInBits'(typeIR)]

. Return ``xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBits''[$sizeof_maxSizeInBits''($canon(typeIR))]``.

xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBits''[$sizeof_maxSizeInBits''(typeIR'')]

. If let ``primitiveTypeIR`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Check that ``primitiveTypeIR`` matches pattern ``+BOOL+``.

 .. Return ``1``.
. Else if let ``numberTypeIR`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. If let ``+INT+ +<+w+>+`` be ``numberTypeIR``:
  ... Return ``w``.
 .. Else if let ``+BIT+ +<+w+>+`` be ``numberTypeIR``:
  ... Return ``w``.
 .. Else if let ``+VARBIT+ +<+w+>+`` be ``numberTypeIR``:
  ... Return ``w``.
. Else if let ``aliasTypeIR`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Let!~type~ ``+TYPE+ ++_++ typeIR`` be ``aliasTypeIR``.

 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBits'[$sizeof_maxSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``.
. Else if let ``enumTypeIR`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Let!~type~ ``+ENUM+ ++_++ +#+ typeIR +{+++_++^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``enumTypeIR``.

 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBits'[$sizeof_maxSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``.
. Else if let ``+TUPLE+ +<+typeIR^{asterisk}^+>+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:sum[$sum($sizeof_maxSizeInBits'(typeIR)^{asterisk}^)]``.
. Else if let ``typeIR +[+n~size~+]+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBits'[$sizeof_maxSizeInBits'(typeIR)]`` * ``n~size~``.
. Else if let ``+STRUCT+ ++_++ +{+( typeIR ++_++ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:sum[$sum($sizeof_maxSizeInBits'(typeIR)^{asterisk}^)]``.
. Else if let ``+HEADER+ ++_++ +{+( typeIR ++_++ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:sum[$sum($sizeof_maxSizeInBits'(typeIR)^{asterisk}^)]``.
. Else if let ``+HEADER_UNION+ ++_++ +{+( typeIR ++_++ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:max[$max($sizeof_maxSizeInBits'(typeIR)^{asterisk}^)]``.

xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBytes[$sizeof_maxSizeInBytes(typeIR)]

. Let ``n~size~`` be ``xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBits'[$sizeof_maxSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``.
. Return ``+D+ n~size~ / 8``.

xref:prefixedNonTypeName[$prefixedNonTypeName(prefixedNonTypeName)]

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``nonTypeName`` be ``prefixedNonTypeName``.

  ... Return ``xref:name[$name(nonTypeName)]``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``+.+ nonTypeName`` be ``prefixedNonTypeName``.

  ... Return ``+.+ xref:name[$name(nonTypeName)]``.

xref:prefixedTypeName[$prefixedTypeName(prefixedTypeName)]

