xref:check_arity_more[$check_arity_more(id~arg~^?^^{asterisk}^, id~param~^{asterisk}^)]

. Return the length of ``id~arg~^?^^{asterisk}^`` is greater than the length of ``id~param~^{asterisk}^``.

