xref:get_missing_parameters[$get_missing_parameters(id^{asterisk}^, id~arg~^{asterisk}^)]

. If ``id^{asterisk}^`` matches pattern ``[]``:
 .. Return ``·``.
. Else:
 .. Check that ``~xref:in_set[$in_set<id>(id~param_h~, +{+id~arg~^{asterisk}^+}+)]``.

 .. Return ``id~param_h~ {two-colons} xref:get_missing_parameters[$get_missing_parameters(id~param_t~^{asterisk}^, id~arg~^{asterisk}^)]``.

. Otherwise:
 .. Otherwise:
  ... Check that ``id^{asterisk}^`` is a non-empty list.

  ... Let ``id~param_h~ {two-colons} id~param_t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``id^{asterisk}^``.
  ... Return ``xref:get_missing_parameters[$get_missing_parameters(id~param_t~^{asterisk}^, id~arg~^{asterisk}^)]``.

xref:find_match_named[$find_match_named<V>(rid, V, id~arg~^{asterisk}^, pid'^{asterisk}^)]

. Let ``id~param~ +#+ bool~param~`` be ``pid'``, for all ``pid'`` in ``pid'^{asterisk}^``, ``bool~param~`` in ``bool~param~^{asterisk}^``, and ``id~param~`` in ``id~param~^{asterisk}^``.
. Check that ``xref:eq_set[$eq_set<id>(+{+id~arg~^{asterisk}^+}+, +{+id~param~^{asterisk}^+}+)]``.

. Return ( ``rid``, ``V``, ``·`` ).

. Otherwise:
 .. Otherwise:
  ... Return ``·``.

xref:find_match_named_default[$find_match_named_default<V>(rid, V, id~arg~^{asterisk}^, pid'^{asterisk}^)]

. Let ``id~param~ +#+ bool~param~`` be ``pid'``, for all ``pid'`` in ``pid'^{asterisk}^``, ``bool~param~`` in ``bool~param~^{asterisk}^``, and ``id~param~`` in ``id~param~^{asterisk}^``.
. Let ``id~default~^{asterisk}^`` be ``xref:get_missing_parameters[$get_missing_parameters(id~param~^{asterisk}^, id~arg~^{asterisk}^)]``.
. Check that ``xref:find_match_named[$find_match_named<V>(rid, V, id~arg~^{asterisk}^ {pp} id~default~^{asterisk}^, ( id~param~ +#+ bool~param~ )^{asterisk}^)]`` is not equal to ``·``.

. Return ( ``rid``, ``V``, ``id~default~^{asterisk}^`` ).

. Otherwise:
