xref:find_match_unnamed_default[$find_match_unnamed_default<V>(rid, V, id~arg~^?^^{asterisk}^, pid^{asterisk}^)]

. Let ``( ++_++^{asterisk}^, ( id~default~ +#+ bool )^{asterisk}^ )`` be ``xref:partition_[$partition_<pid>(pid^{asterisk}^, the length of id~arg~^?^^{asterisk}^)]``.
. Check that ``bool`` is equal to ``true``, for all ``bool`` in ``bool^{asterisk}^``.

. Return ( ``rid``, ``V``, ``id~default~^{asterisk}^`` ).

