    ..... Let xref:Call_ok[``p' TC' ⊢ routineTypeIR +<+· +#+ tid~infer~^{asterisk}^+>+ +(+argumentIR^{asterisk}^ +#+ id~default~^{asterisk}^+)+ +:+ typeIR~ret~ +<+typeArgumentIR~inferred~^{asterisk}^+>+ +(+argumentIR~cast~^{asterisk}^+)+``].
    ..... Let ``callStatementIR`` be ``routineTargetIR +<+typeArgumentIR~inferred~^{asterisk}^+>+ +(+argumentIR~cast~^{asterisk}^+)+ +;+``.
