    ..... Result in ``TC'``, ``f~post~``, and ``+IF+ +(+typedExpressionIR~cond~+)+ statementIR~then~ +ELSE+ statementIR~else~``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Check that ``p'`` matches pattern ``+LOCAL+``.

