     ...... Let ``n~delta~`` be ``TBLC'.+PRIORITIES+.+DELTA+``.
     ...... Let ``n`` be ``n~last~`` - ``n~delta~``.
     ...... Let ``TBLC~1~`` be ``xref:add_table_priority[$add_table_priority(TBLC', n)]``.
     ...... Result in ``TBLC~1~`` and ``+PRIORITY+ +=+ +D+ n +:+``.
    ..... Else:
     ...... Let ``n~last~`` be ``xref:find_table_priority_last[$find_table_priority_last(TBLC')]``.
     ...... Let ``n~delta~`` be ``TBLC'.+PRIORITIES+.+DELTA+``.
     ...... Let ``n`` be ``n~last~`` + ``n~delta~``.
     ...... Let ``TBLC~1~`` be ``xref:add_table_priority[$add_table_priority(TBLC', n)]``.
     ...... Result in ``TBLC~1~`` and ``+PRIORITY+ +=+ +D+ n +:+``.
. Else:
 .. If let ``+PRIORITY+ +=+ number +:+`` be ``tableEntryPriority``:
