xref:Call_convention_expr_ok[Call_convention_expr_ok: ``p TC actctxt ⊢ direction typeIR~param~ ++_++ ++_++^?^ +@+ typedExpressionIR~arg~ +:+ %``]

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... If ``direction`` matches pattern ``+IN+``:
   .... Let ``typedExpressionIR~arg_cast~`` be xref:option_get[*!*] ``xref:coerce_unary[$coerce_unary(typedExpressionIR~arg~, typeIR~param~)]``.
   .... Result in ``typedExpressionIR~arg_cast~``.
  ... Else if ``direction`` matches pattern ``+OUT+``:
   .... Let ``++_++ +#+ +(+typeIR~arg~ ++_+++)+`` be ``typedExpressionIR~arg~``.
   .... If xref:Type_alpha[``typeIR~param~ +~~+ typeIR~arg~``] holds:
    ..... If xref:Expr_lvalue_ok[``p TC ⊢ typedExpressionIR~arg~``] holds:
     ...... Result in ``typedExpressionIR~arg~``.
  ... Else if ``direction`` matches pattern ``+INOUT+``:
   .... Let ``++_++ +#+ +(+typeIR~arg~ ++_+++)+`` be ``typedExpressionIR~arg~``.
   .... If xref:Type_alpha[``typeIR~param~ +~~+ typeIR~arg~``] holds:
    ..... If xref:Expr_lvalue_ok[``p TC ⊢ typedExpressionIR~arg~``] holds:
     ...... Result in ``typedExpressionIR~arg~``.
 .. {empty}
  ... If ``actctxt`` matches pattern ``+ACTION+``:
   .... Check that ``direction`` matches pattern ````.

   .... Let ``typedExpressionIR~arg_cast~`` be xref:option_get[*!*] ``xref:coerce_unary[$coerce_unary(typedExpressionIR~arg~, typeIR~param~)]``.
   .... Result in ``typedExpressionIR~arg_cast~``.
  ... Else:
   .... Check that ``direction`` matches pattern ````.

   .... Let ``++_++ +#+ +(+typeIR~arg~ ctk~arg~+)+`` be ``typedExpressionIR~arg~``.
   .... If xref:Type_alpha[``typeIR~param~ +~~+ typeIR~arg~``] holds:
    ..... Check that ``ctk~arg~`` does not match pattern ``+DYN+``.

    ..... Result in ``typedExpressionIR~arg~``.

xref:Call_convention_argument_ok[Call_convention_argument_ok: ``p TC actctxt ⊢ parameterTypeIR +@+ argumentIR +:+ %``]

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``typedExpressionIR`` be ``argumentIR``.

  ... Let xref:Call_convention_expr_ok[``p TC actctxt ⊢ parameterTypeIR +@+ typedExpressionIR +:+ typedExpressionIR~cast~``].
