xref:RoutineTarget_ok[RoutineTarget_ok: ``p TC ⊢ routineTarget' +:+ %``]

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... If let ``prefixedNonTypeName`` be ``routineTarget'``:
   .... Let ``prefixedNameIR`` be ``xref:prefixedNonTypeName[$prefixedNonTypeName(prefixedNonTypeName)]``.
   .... Check that if ``prefixedNameIR`` is equal to ``"verify"`` or ``prefixedNameIR`` is equal to ``+.+ "verify"``, then ``p`` is equal to ``+BLOCK+`` and ``xref:is_parser_blockKind[$is_parser_blockKind(TC.+BLOCK+.+KIND+)]`` or ``p`` is equal to ``+LOCAL+`` and ``xref:is_parser_state_localKind[$is_parser_state_localKind(TC.+LOCAL+.+KIND+)]``.

