    ..... Let ``prefixedNameIR`` be ``xref:prefixedTypeName[$prefixedTypeName(prefixedTypeName)]``.
    ..... Let ``nameIR`` be ``xref:name[$name(member)]``.
    ..... Result in ``+TYPE+ prefixedNameIR +.+ nameIR``.
   .... Else:
    ..... Let ``nameIR`` be ``xref:name[$name(member)]``.
    ..... Let xref:Expr_ok[``p TC ⊢ expression~base~ +:+ typedExpressionIR~base~``].
    ..... Result in ``typedExpressionIR~base~ +.+ nameIR``.
  ... Else if let ``+(+expression+)+`` be ``routineTarget'``:
   .... Let xref:RoutineTarget_ok[``p TC ⊢ expression +:+ routineTargetIR``].
   .... Result in ``+(+routineTargetIR+)+``.
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``referenceExpression`` be ``routineTarget'``.

  ... Check that ``referenceExpression`` matches pattern ``+THIS+``.

  ... Result in ``"this"``.

