xref:RoutineType_ok[RoutineType_ok: ``p TC ⊢ routineTargetIR'' +<+typeArgumentIR^{asterisk}^+>+ +(+argumentIR''^{asterisk}^+)+ +:+ % +<++#+ %+>+ +(++#+ %+)+``]

