xref:Call_ok[Call_ok: ``p TC ⊢ routineTypeIR +<+typeArgumentIR^{asterisk}^ +#+ tid'^{asterisk}^+>+ +(+argumentIR^{asterisk}^ +#+ id~default'~^{asterisk}^+)+ +:+ % +<+%+>+ +(+%+)+``]

. If let ``functionTypeIR`` be ``routineTypeIR``:
 .. If let ``+BUILTIN_FUNCTION+ +(+parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^+)+ +->+ typeIR~ret~`` be ``functionTypeIR``:
