xref:coerce_unary[$coerce_unary(typedExpressionIR, typeIR~to~)]

. Let ``++_++ +#+ +(+typeIR ++_+++)+`` be ``typedExpressionIR``.
. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... If xref:Type_alpha[``typeIR +~~+ typeIR~to~``] holds:
