    ..... Return ( ``typedExpressionIR~l_cast~``, ``typedExpressionIR~r~`` ).
 .. {empty}
  ... If xref:Type_alpha[``typeIR~l~ +~~+ typeIR~r~``] does not hold:
   .... If xref:Cast_impl[``typeIR~l~ → typeIR~r~``] does not hold:
    ..... If xref:Cast_impl[``typeIR~r~ → typeIR~l~``] holds:
     ...... Let ``typedExpressionIR~r_cast~`` be ``+(+typeIR~l~+)+ typedExpressionIR~r~ +#+ +(+typeIR~l~ ++_+++)+``.
     ...... Return ( ``typedExpressionIR~l~``, ``typedExpressionIR~r_cast~`` ).

. Otherwise:
