. Let ``cenv`` be ``xref:add_map[$add_map<cid, consDyn>(Ci.+GLOBAL+.+CENV+, cid, consDyn)]``.
. Return ``Ci`` with ``+GLOBAL+.+CENV+`` set to ``cenv``.

